( Minimal reproduction of the bug in nc_files/nestedcall.ngc line 11.      )
( An O-word subroutine must be invoked with the keyword 'call'.  This file  )
( instead uses 'callsub' (a typo).  The RS274NGC reader matches o-word       )
( commands by prefix, so 'callsub' prefix-matches 'call', the reader         )
( advances past 'call', and then rejects the leftover 'sub' with the error   )
( "Unexpected character after O-word" -- so the subroutine never runs.       )
( Fix: change 'callsub' to 'call' (here and in nc_files/nestedcall.ngc:11).  )
o<mysub> sub
  (subroutine was entered)
o<mysub> endsub
o<mysub> callsub
m2
